		(descr "ESP32-C3 SuperMini (18 x 22.52 mm) on two 1x8 2.54 mm female headers, rows 15.24 mm apart. Top view, components up, USB at the top: right column pads 1-8 = 5V, GND, 3V3, IO4, IO3, IO2, IO1, IO0; left column pads 9-16 = IO5, IO6, IO7, IO8, IO9, IO10, IO20, IO21, both top to bottom. Courtyard covers only the header strips so low parts can sit under the module.")
